    "detailed_description": "\u30fbStory<br>In the abyss, she is awakened by the cold.<br>She has nothing to hold on to, as everything is left in the darkness.<br><br>The girl moves on with a little light,<br>and leaves all the choices to you.<br><br>Guide her and find her lost self.<br><br>\u30fbGameplay<br>This is a roguelite deckbuilder game where you aim for higher floor while making your own unique deck.<br>You can get different card or raise your stats by encounter various event and enemies.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356470/extras/e4394cea81abbd7a7dd0e5dd80236bf0.avif?t=1733273342\" /></span><br><br>\u30fbFeatures<br>Use card to attack enemy or strengthen yourself during combat.<br>There will be 40+ type of card where you can build various unique deck like magic-specialized deck and etc.<br>Althought the starting deck will always be same, you can add up to 30 cards to your deck in your adventure.<br><br>Even with same battles and event, you can unlock various H scenes by meeting condition such as having specific debuffs!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2356470/extras/5c6d4d78e45a7035d64e7de1609bb32a.avif?t=1733273342\" /></span>",
